 "identity", "target_term": "恒等"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "essentially constant", "target_term": "本质常值的"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若<MATH_0001>是本质常值系统（essentially constant system），且态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>是单态射（monomorphisms），则对于所有充分大（large）的<MATH_0003>，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>都是同构（isomorphisms）。另一方面，考虑系统（system）\n<MATH_0005>\n其映射（maps）由<MATH_0006>给出。这个系统（system）是本质常值的（essentially constant），其值为<MATH_0007>，但每个过渡映射（transition map）都有核（kernel）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下面给出一个不是本质常值的（essentially constant）系统（system）的例子。设<MATH_0008>，并令<MATH_0009>为移位算子（shift operator）<MATH_0010>。在此情形下，系统（system）<MATH_0011>的过渡映射（transition maps）为<MATH_0012>，其余极限（colimit）为<MATH_0013>，且合成（composition）<MATH_0014>是恒等（identity），但这个系统（system）不是本质常值的（essentially constant）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n下面的引理是一项合理性检验。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:a8e00b46560daa26c967737d8e79f7f637ab20c857ee68635daf028e0cbbe0ae", "unit_id": "tag:05PT:prose-0003", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本节已定义的系统性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "essentially constant system", "target_term": "本质常值系统"}, {"context": "系统的结构箭头；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "过渡态射的假设；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "monomorphisms", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"context": "指标充分大的条件；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "large", "target_term": "大"}, {"context": "最终过渡态射的性质；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "本段的有向系统；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"context": "构成系统的映射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "系统的本质常值性；暂定译法。", "source_term": "essentially constant", "target_term": "本质常值的"}, {"context": "系统中的单个过渡映射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "transition map", "target_term": "过渡映射"}, {"context": "原文所述过渡映射的核，不增添非零限定；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"context": "本段定义的算子；暂定译法。", "source_term": "shift operator", "target_term": "移位算子"}, {"context": "第二个系统的过渡映射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "过渡映射"}, {"context": "该系统的余极限；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"context": "所给两个映射的合成；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"context": "零对象的恒等；暂定译法。", "source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等"}]}
